  @UC-001.11
  Scenario: Cannot place order with coupon that has exceeded usage limit
    Given a coupon with coupon code "LIMITED2024", with usage limit 2
    And an order with order number "ORD-1", with coupon code "LIMITED2024"
    And an order with order number "ORD-2", with coupon code "LIMITED2024"
    When place order with order number "ORD-3", with coupon code "LIMITED2024"
    Then should fail
    And error message "The request contains one or more validation errors"
    And field error message "couponCode", "Coupon code LIMITED2024 has exceeded its usage limit"

