Feature: Untagged acceptance tests

  Scenario: Should reject reusing an idempotency key for a different order
    Given an order with idempotency key "ORDER-KEY", with quantity "1"
    And logged in as customer
    When place order with order number "SECOND-ORDER", with idempotency key "ORDER-KEY", with quantity "2"
    Then should fail
    And error message "Idempotency-Key has already been used with a different request"
